                </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
<span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text block mb-1">Standard Packaging</span>
<span class="text-xs text-heading-black block font-medium mb-4">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="products-agricultural-oils" href="products.html#agricultural-oils">
                  View product →
                </a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- 06 Hydraulic Oils -->
<div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-page-bg transition-colors">
<div>
<div class="w-full aspect-[4/3] bg-product-frame border border-hairline relative p-4 mb-6 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center"><span class="absolute top-3 left-3 font-serif italic text-2xl text-light-text">06</span><div class="text-center px-4"><p class="font-serif italic text-sm text-body-text max-w-xs leading-relaxed">[Photograph: Pack shot of Unicore Hydraulic Oil drum]</p></div></div>
<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-2">Hydraulic Oils</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  Industrial fluids that keep hydraulic pumps and factory machinery operating smoothly without power loss.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
<span class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider text-light-text block mb-1">Standard Packaging</span>
<span class="text-xs text-heading-black block font-medium mb-4">[to be confirmed by Unicore]</span>
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="products-industrial-hydraulic-oils" href="products.html#industrial-hydraulic-oils">
                  View product →
                </a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 4: TYRE SEALANT GEL TEASER -->
<section class="w-full bg-white border-b border-hairline py-16 lg:py-20">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="border border-hairline bg-page-bg p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16">
<div class="max-w-4xl">
<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-4">
<span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-logo-blue">Specialty Products</span>
</div>
<h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-6">Tyre Sealant Gel for tubeless tyres</h2>
<p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-8">Our heavy gel coats the inside of tubeless tyres and automatically fills punctures as you continue driving on the road. It stops slow air leaks across hot highways and rough work sites.</p>
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="tyre-sealant" href="tyre-sealant.html">
                Explore Tyre Sealant Gel →
              </a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- SECTION 5: APPLICATIONS (Five Cards in a Hairline Row) -->
<section class="w-full bg-white py-20 border-b border-hairline">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
<div class="mb-12 pb-6 border-b border-hairline"><span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-logo-blue block mb-2">Applications</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl text-heading-black font-normal">Where Our Oils and Lubricants Work</h2></div>
<!-- Single Row with Hairline Borders -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 border-t border-l border-hairline bg-hairline gap-px">
<!-- App 1 -->
<div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-page-bg transition-colors">
<div>
<span class="font-serif italic text-lg text-logo-blue block mb-3">01 / Mobility</span>
<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Two-Wheelers</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  Smooth clutch grip and engine protection for high-mileage motorcycles and automatic scooters.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="applications" href="applications.html">
                  View application →
                </a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- App 2 -->
<div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-page-bg transition-colors">
<div>
<span class="font-serif italic text-lg text-logo-blue block mb-3">02 / Logistics</span>
<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Commercial Fleets</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  Durable lubricants engineered for long-haul trucks and bus fleets running continuous routes.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="applications" href="applications.html">
                  View application →
                </a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- App 3 -->
<div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-page-bg transition-colors">
<div>
<span class="font-serif italic text-lg text-logo-blue block mb-3">03 / Agronomy</span>
<h3 class="font-serif text-2xl text-heading-black font-normal mb-3">Agricultural Machinery</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-6">
                  Reliable protection for tractors, pumps, and harvesters operating in muddy and dusty soil.
                </p>
</div>
<div class="pt-4 border-t border-hairline">
<a class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold text-logo-blue hover:underline inline-flex items-center gap-1" data-path="applications" href="applications.html">
                  View application →
                </a>
</div>
</div>
<!-- App 4 -->
<div class="bg-white p-8 flex flex-col justify-between hover:bg-page-bg transition-colors">
<div>
