<div class="space-y-4 text-base text-body-text leading-relaxed mb-12 max-w-2xl">
<p class="">
                  Every Unicore product is blended in controlled batches with precise heating and thorough mechanical mixing.
                </p>
<p class="">
                  Before packaging starts, our technicians inspect samples from each batch to confirm clarity, weight, and correct flow.
                </p>
</div>
<!-- Three hairline-separated steps -->
<div class="border-t border-hairline divide-y divide-hairline">
<div class="py-6 flex items-start gap-5">
<span class="font-serif italic text-2xl text-logo-blue">01</span>
<div>
<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-heading-black font-normal">Controlled Batch Blending</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text mt-1 leading-relaxed">Oils and additives blended in controlled batches under precise temperature regulation.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="py-6 flex items-start gap-5">
<span class="font-serif italic text-2xl text-logo-blue">02</span>
<div>
<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-heading-black font-normal">Pre-Fill Quality Verification</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text mt-1 leading-relaxed">Sample approval and flow verification before line release.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="py-6 flex items-start gap-5"><span class="font-serif italic text-2xl text-logo-blue">03</span>
<div class="">
<h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-heading-black font-normal">Packing and Sealing</h3>
<p class="text-sm text-body-text mt-1 leading-relaxed">Containers are filled and sealed in clean conditions with clear batch stamping.</p>
</div></div>
</div>
</div>
